Alembic migrations for the tracko-anpr database (PostgreSQL 18).

Run from the project root, in WSL, with the database container up:

    uv run alembic upgrade head        apply every migration
    uv run alembic current             which revision the database is at
    uv run alembic downgrade base      remove everything (tests only)

After changing src/tracko_anpr/db/models.py:

    uv run alembic revision --autogenerate -m "short description"

then read the generated file in versions/ before applying it: autogenerate misses
some changes (renames, server defaults) and must be checked by hand.
